		<h3 class="sec-title">연관 콘텐츠</h3>
		<ul class="item-list">
						<li>
				<article class="item">
					<div class="category">
						<a href="https://www.shinsegaegroupnewsroom.com/category/press/press-release/">보도자료</a>					</div>

					<a href="https://www.shinsegaegroupnewsroom.com/emart-hosts-1st-anniversary-event-for-5k-price/" class="item-link">

